1
00:00:00,532 --> 00:00:04,002
(Amy:)completely rocked
my girlfriend's world in bed.

2
00:00:04,002 --> 00:00:06,302
(stammers)
Amy...

3
00:00:06,304 --> 00:00:08,104
(Amy:)You know the rules.

4
00:00:08,106 --> 00:00:10,206
(Penny:)Drink.

5
00:00:10,208 --> 00:00:11,708
(clears throat)

6
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:12,980
(Penny:)Yeah, go ahead.

7
00:00:15,113 --> 00:00:17,413
(Leonard:)That's right.

8
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:19,750
(Sheldon:)All right, my turn.

9
00:00:19,751 --> 00:00:20,751
(Sheldon:)Mm...

10
00:00:20,752 --> 00:00:22,382
(Sheldon:)Oh, I know.

11
00:00:22,387 --> 00:00:26,127
(Penny:)Never have I ever
kept a secret bank account,

12
00:00:26,124 --> 00:00:29,424
(Sheldon:)because I think
my wife can't handle money.

13
00:00:33,298 --> 00:00:34,298
(Sheldon:)Did I win?

14
00:00:34,299 --> 00:00:36,799
(Sheldon:)I feel like I won.

15
00:00:36,801 --> 00:00:38,331
(Penny:)I can't believe this.

16
00:00:38,336 --> 00:00:41,066
(Penny:)You realize I make
more money than you?

17
00:00:41,072 --> 00:00:42,772
(Leonard:)I don't, I know,
but this isn't a big deal.

18
00:00:42,774 --> 00:00:45,074
(Leonard:)It's just a little savings
I put aside.

19
00:00:45,076 --> 00:00:46,146
(Penny:)We're married.

20
00:00:46,144 --> 00:00:47,474
(Penny:)We're supposed
to share everything.

21
00:00:47,479 --> 00:00:50,509
(Leonard:)What... you mean, like,
your massive credit card debt?

22
00:00:54,719 --> 00:00:56,319
(door slams)

23
00:00:56,321 --> 00:00:57,321
(Sheldon:)I'm calling it.

24
00:00:57,322 --> 00:01:01,022
(Sheldon:)I won.

